      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of late thrombosis of a sirolimus-eluting stent, 16 months after implantation, is described. Two weeks prior to presentation with stent thrombosis the patient had a 50% dose increase of longterm erythropoietin. The prothrombotic effect of erythropoietin may have precipitated the thrombotic event."},
